              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "फूँकना — phū̃knā — \"to blow (on); to squander\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "दादी ने फूँककर दीया बुझाया। dādī ne phū̃kkar dīyā bujhāyā. Grandmother blew out the lamp."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने अपना पैसा फूँक दिया, usne apnā paisā phū̃k diyā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पैसा फूँकना (phū̃knā), to blow your money."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "फूँकना (phū̃knā) goes back to phūtka, \"blowing\", a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 9102), which lists Hindi phū̃knā, \"to blow\". Money that is blown on is gone like smoke."
            }
